# Line endings are load-bearing here: a CRLF `gradlew` fails on Linux with "bad interpreter", and a
# line-ending-converted Gradle wrapper jar is corrupt. Stating the rules beats depending on whatever
# `core.autocrlf` each machine happens to use.
android/gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
